[{:db/id -1, :adr/id "adr-2605080800-iryo-hospital-ops-phase1", :adr/title "ADR-2605080800: iryo.etzhayyim.com hospital operations Phase 1", :adr/status "proposed", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/source-format "edn", :adr/body "\n# ADR 2605080800 — iryo.etzhayyim.com hospital operations Phase 1\n\n**Status**: proposed\n**Date**: 2026-05-08\n**Supersedes**: none\n**Amends**: ADR-0056 (BPMN-as-actor), ADR-2604282300 (T2 = kotodama+Zeebe)\n\n## Context\n\n`60-apps/` には病院運営に直接対応する actor / project が無い。隣接資産:\n\n- `medical-coverage-{ingester,mcp}` (PubMed / ClinicalTrials.gov / facility CSV ingest, MCP control plane)\n- `etzhayyim-root/00-contracts/bpmn/com/etzhayyim/{open-fhir-health-data,open-universal-health-coverage,open-one-health}/` (政策/標準 BPMN 雛形)\n- `cofog/0731-hospital-services` / `0732-specialized-hospital-services` (政府機能分類 stub)\n- `kenkyusha` / `natural-person` / `mold-allergy` / `sensitive-taima` / `ethics` (周辺文脈の言及のみ)\n\nこれらは **病院ドメインの operational subject** ではなく、ingest / 規制 / 個人健康側の actor。病院そのものを actor として扱う graph + agent loop は欠落している。\n\n## Decision\n\n`did:web:iryo.etzhayyim.com` を医療 umbrella actor として新設し、Phase 1 ではその下の `:hospital` sub-DID で acute-care 病院運営を実装する。Phase 2/3 で `:clinic` / `:zaitaku` (在宅医療) を追加可能な path-based topology を取る。\n\n実装方式は **pure T2 (ADR-2604282300)** — CF Worker を持たず、kotodama + Zeebe BPMN-as-actor のみで構成する。`iryo.etzhayyim.com` は did:web 解決とドキュメント公開だけに使い、外部 entrypoint は bpmn-dispatcher 経由 XRPC + 内部 timer-start BPMN とする。\n\n### Identity topology\n\n```\ndid:web:iryo.etzhayyim.com                     (umbrella, Phase 1+)\n  └── did:web:iryo.etzhayyim.com:hospital      (Phase 1 root)\n        ├── :hospital:dept:{slug}        (e.g. :dept:cardiology, :dept:icu)\n        ├── :hospital:ward:{slug}        (e.g. :ward:icu-3f, :ward:gen-5f)\n        └── :hospital:role:{md|rn|admin} (clinical role facets)\n  └── did:web:iryo.etzhayyim.com:clinic        (Phase 2, deferred)\n  └── did:web:iryo.etzhayyim.com:zaitaku       (Phase 3, deferred)\n```\n\n### Claim cycle: Generic DRG (international)\n\n国際展開を優先し、JP DPC 固有 column 名 (`dpc_code`, `shinryo_ka_code`) は採らない。schema は **ICD-10 + DRG-style packaged billing** で表現し、JP DPC / US MS-DRG / EU AR-DRG / AU AR-DRG が同 schema に flow できる column 名を取る:\n\n| concept | column | 採用名 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 主病名 | ICD-10 principal diagnosis | `principal_diagnosis_code` |\n| 副病名 | ICD-10 secondary diagnoses | `secondary_diagnosis_codes_json` |\n| DRG package | DRG group code | `drg_code` (JP DPC は 14-digit を保持) |\n| 診療科 | specialty | `specialty_code` (ICD-O / SNOMED specialty / ICD-10 chapter) |\n| 在院日数 | length of stay | `length_of_stay_days` |\n| 重症度 | severity | `severity_tier` (1=minor, 2=moderate, 3=severe, 4=critical) |\n| 包括点数 | package points | `package_points` (DOUBLE PRECISION, JP DPC pt / US MS-DRG weight × base rate) |\n\nJP DPC 固有 mapping は Phase 2 で `vertex_iryo_drg_mapping_jp` を別 vertex として追加する。\n\n### Data sources (triple)\n\n実データなしでは BPMN が空テーブルで空踊りする。Phase 1 は以下 3 経路を併用:\n\n1. **Synthetic seed (A)** — bootstrap で架空 300-bed 病院を seed + R/PT15M で admit/discharge/transfer 合成イベント発火。1日約100件の入退院 + 200件のbed transition を生成。\n2. **FHIR sync (B)** — HAPI FHIR R4 public test server (`hapi.fhir.org/baseR4`) から Patient / Encounter / Observation を R/P1D で sync。実 schema 検証 + 国際接続 contract を持つ。\n3. **Public stats (C)** — WHO Global Health Observatory + OECD Health Statistics + JP 厚労省 病院年鑑 を R/P30D で ingest。マクロ KPI ベンチマーク用。\n\n経営ダッシュボード agent は (A) を一次ソース、(B)(C) を context として使う。\n\n## Schema\n\n新規 graph テーブル (8 vertex + 4 edge + 5 streaming MV):\n\n```\nvertex_iryo_hospital               hospital roster (300-bed seed)\nvertex_iryo_dept                   department (cardiology, icu, ...)\nvertex_iryo_ward                   ward (physical bed group)\nvertex_iryo_bed                    individual bed unit\nvertex_iryo_staff                  clinical / admin staff\nvertex_iryo_encounter              admission-discharge cycle (Patient × Encounter)\nvertex_iryo_drg_claim              DRG-coded claim (one per discharge)\nvertex_iryo_staff_shift            shift roster (8h block)\nvertex_iryo_health_kpi             ingested WHO/OECD/MHLW indicator value\n\nedge_iryo_dept_in_hospital         dept → hospital\nedge_iryo_ward_in_dept             ward → dept (1:N)\nedge_iryo_bed_in_ward              bed → ward\nedge_iryo_encounter_in_bed         encounter → bed (current/last placement)\n\nmv_iryo_bed_occupancy_now          per-ward occupancy snapshot (low cardinality)\nmv_iryo_los_by_drg_daily           avg/median LOS per drg_code per day\nmv_iryo_admission_count_by_dept    per-dept admit count (rolling 30d)\nmv_iryo_drg_pnl_daily              package_points × tariff − cost estimate\nmv_iryo_staff_coverage_gap         shifts where required headcount > rostered\n```\n\nVertex IDs follow ADR-0041 content-addressed PK pattern:\n`at://did:web:iryo.etzhayyim.com:hospital/com.etzhayyim.apps.iryo.{collection}/{rkey}`.\n\nPII tier (ADR-0018):\n- Tier 1 (federable): hospital / dept / ward / bed / staff / health_kpi (code/category/aggregate only)\n- Tier 3 (server-only, not implemented Phase 1): patient PHI — Phase 1 では合成データのみ扱うため `vertex_iryo_encounter.patient_did` は安定 hash + age band + sex + admission timestamp のみ保持し、姓名・住所・MRN は持たない\n\n## BPMN actors (4 + 1 timer)\n\n| BPMN process_id | trigger | task chain |\n|---|---|---|\n| `iryo_admission_discharge_cycle` | XRPC `submitEncounter` / `dischargeEncounter` | encounter.upsert → bed.assign / bed.release → audit |\n| `iryo_drg_claim_cycle` | timer `0 0 2 1 * ?` (monthly day 1, 02:00 UTC) | claim.batchSubmit → audit。reactive `iryo_drg_claim_adjustment` は XRPC denial event で発火 (Phase 1.1) |\n| `iryo_bed_occupancy_and_shift` | R/PT1H | bed.recompute_occupancy → shift.coverage_gap → audit |\n| `iryo_agent_loop` | XRPC `agentLoop` | agent.chat (Path F) → audit |\n| `iryo_synthetic_event_tick` | R/PT15M (Phase 1 only) | synthetic.advance_clock → audit |\n| `iryo_fhir_sync` | R/P1D | fhir.sync_patient → fhir.sync_encounter → fhir.sync_observation → audit |\n| `iryo_health_kpi_refresh` | R/P30D | kpi.refresh_who_gho → kpi.refresh_oecd → kpi.refresh_mhlw → audit |\n\n## XRPC surface (Phase 1, 8 lexicons)\n\n`com.etzhayyim.apps.iryo.*` 全て bpmn-dispatcher 経由 (`http://dispatcher.etzhayyim.com:8080/xrpc/{nsid}`):\n\n| NSID | type | purpose |\n|---|---|---|\n| `coverage` | query | counts of hospital/dept/ward/bed/encounter, mv freshness |\n| `listEncounters` | query | encounters by dept/ward/window |\n| `getBedOccupancy` | query | snapshot from `mv_iryo_bed_occupancy_now` |\n| `getDrgClaim` | query | claim by id |\n| `submitEncounter` | procedure | admit + bed assignment |\n| `dischargeEncounter` | procedure | discharge + bed release + auto DRG draft |\n| `submitDrgClaim` | procedure | finalize DRG-coded claim |\n| `agentLoop` | procedure | path F unified agent loop |\n\n## Stack\n\n新 ADR stack に準拠 (shosha が pre-dates するため引き写しではなく新規パターン):\n\n- L6 boundary validation: **Pydantic v2** (ADR-2605080200) — `ZeebeJobInput` / `ZeebeJobOutput`\n- Hot-path SQL: **SQLAlchemy Core** (ADR-2605080300) — `sa_execute()` / `sa_query()` (no ORM)\n- Migrations: **Alembic** (ADR-2605080400) — Python-owned tables (`pyzeebe_checkpoint` 等) は Alembic、graph vertex/edge/mv は Kysely timestamp migration を踏襲\n- MV: **SQLMesh** (ADR-2605080500) — `sqlmesh/models/mv_iryo_*.sql` を SSoT、Kysely migration は initial CREATE のみ\n\n## Helm\n\n`50-infra/vultr/mitama-iryo-pool/` を `mitama-shosha-pool` 同形パターンで新設。`mitama-udf` namespace 共有、`iryo-zeebe-worker` Deployment が `ZEEBE_WORKER_PROFILE=iryo` で `iryo.{encounter.upsert, bed.assign, bed.release, claim.batchSubmit, claim.draft, agent.chat, bed.recompute_occupancy, shift.coverage_gap, synthetic.advance_clock, fhir.sync_*, kpi.refresh_*}` を排他登録。\n\n## Migration phases\n\n| Phase | 内容 | trigger to next |\n|---|---|---|\n| **1a** (this ADR) | ADR + lexicons + schema migration + Helm pool 雛形 | schema applied, drift clean |\n| **1b** | 4 BPMN + pyzeebe primitive + 合成 seed | XRPC end-to-end smoke (synthetic 300-bed, 1 admit→discharge→DRG) |\n| **1c** | FHIR sync + WHO/OECD ingest + SQLMesh MVs | 1 FHIR Patient → encounter row, KPI refresh tick green |\n| **2** | JP DPC mapping + multi-day approval state machine + denial handling | (deferred) |\n| **3** | `:clinic` / `:zaitaku` sub-DID 拡張、HL7 v2 → FHIR adapter | (deferred) |\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- 実 PHI (実患者) 受入 — Phase 1 は synthetic seed + FHIR public test data のみ\n- 保険会社レセプト電子請求 (REZEPT/EDI) — Phase 2+ で MHLW 様式 1 / 様式 4 / D ファイル出力を検討\n- 院内ナースコール / モニタリングデバイス IoT — out of scope\n- DICOM 画像管理 — out of scope\n- 電子カルテ vendor (HOPE/Husic/MegaOak/ETOCS) との連携 — out of scope\n\n## References\n\n- ADR-0036 Worker-direct Hyperdrive\n- ADR-0041 Content-addressed PK\n- ADR-0056 BPMN-as-actor\n- ADR-0018 PII Tier 3\n- ADR-2604282300 T2 = kotodama + Zeebe\n- ADR-2604240946 4-tier hybrid loop\n- ADR-2605080200/0300/0400/0500 Pydantic v2 / SQLAlchemy Core / Alembic / SQLMesh\n- shosha Phase 1 (precedent)\n- adsk HF dataset ingest (precedent for `vertex_hf_dataset` style external ingest)\n", :adr/path "90-docs/adr/2605080800-iryo-hospital-ops-phase1.edn", :adr/source-repo "root", :adr/topic "iryo-hospital-ops-phase1", :adr/last_verified "2026-05-08", :adr/date "2026-05-08", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/authoritative_for ["iryo.etzhayyim.com hospital actor topology" "hospital operations Phase 1 data sources" "hospital DRG graph schema direction"]}]
